# idl/natives.list — the subsystems (IDL basenames) the natives emitter
# (gen/emit_natives.mjs) generates for, one per line. A subsystem listed here
# must be carried by the bronze native vocabulary in full: every member the
# vocabulary refuses is either respelled in the IDL or marked [manual].
#
# These are the engine's own subsystems — the ones bro carries under
# src/bronze_host/natives/<sub>/ with hand-written bodies in
# src/bronze_host/native_<sub>.cpp. A sibling library's surface (bro.mesh,
# bro.lm, bro.tensor, bro.audio, ...) is NOT listed: since the host logic
# moved into the siblings, each registers its natives by hand in its own
# src/api/, and a generated tree here would be one nothing compiles. The
# sibling IDLs stay for the docs and the .d.ts.
#
# Everything not listed is documented (docs, .d.ts) but has no generated
# natives.
time
window
settings
paths
dunder_bro
net
physics
scene
terrain
clipmap
tile_world
lighting
animation
gizmo
motion
